# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Course content is NEVER committed to this repo.
#
# This repo ships the Odin and Freja skills only. Lecture notes, textbook
# chapters, homework problems and answer keys belong to whoever wrote them --
# often a publisher or an institution -- and must not end up in a public
# repository by accident. Everything below is ignored on purpose.
#
# If you fork this to run your own course, keep these rules unless you are
# certain you hold the rights to the material you are about to commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Lectures/
Literature/
Homeworks/
CheatSheets/
Solutions/
solutions/

# Personal/machine-local Claude Code overrides (not shared)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Editor swap files
*.swp
*~

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
